27:["$","section","Budget for the exact location and mobility pattern",{"id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Budget for the exact location and mobility pattern"}],[["$","p","For a joint degree, note where each semester is taught, what travel is provided and whether visa or residence permissions change along the way. For a single-country award, compare the stipend and housing support with that city's actual expenses.",{"children":"For a joint degree, note where each semester is taught, what travel is provided and whether visa or residence permissions change along the way. For a single-country award, compare the stipend and housing support with that city's actual expenses."}],["$","p","Build a shortlist with degree title, official source, eligibility, confirmed deadline, funding exclusions and your next step. Consider the UK scholarship routes separately when comparing Europe because their university-offer and citizenship rules differ.",{"children":"Build a shortlist with degree title, official source, eligibility, confirmed deadline, funding exclusions and your next step. Consider the UK scholarship routes separately when comparing Europe because their university-offer and citizenship rules differ."}]],"$undefined"]}]
